---
title: Claire's green relish
---

Chop the @cucumbers{12}, @onions{12}, @green peppers{6} and @red peppers{2}. Add @salt{8%tsp} and let sit overnight to draw out excess water. Drain thoroughly the next morning.

Heat the @vinegar{4%cups}, @sugar{6%cups}, @mustard seeds{2%tsp} and @celery seeds{2%tsp} in a saucepan. Bring to a boil, then add the vegetables.

Once everything is thoroughly heated through, transfer to jars, removing any air bubbles. Seal jars and store in a cool area.